					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4700202,
					"content": "「猎鹿人」的渔人吐司真是太棒了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4700203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4700203,
					"content": "不过，其实这在蒙德城也算是一道配方公开的经典传统菜。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4700204
